  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/rendering.html#anonymous-button-content-box\n\n@emilio said in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14187#issuecomment-4990703061\n\n> Button no longer has an anonymous box in blink and gecko afaict.\n\n@bfgeek said in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14190#issuecomment-4994524961\n\n> Oh FWIW we don't have the anonymous button content box due to using an align-content type thing for centering.\n\nSo I guess the \"anonymous button content box\" should be replaced with either the \"align-content type thing\" or just plain `align-content` in UA stylesheet (being discussed in https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/14190)",
